   "description": "What is plugged into port 12. Ports 1 and 2 are the console's own when no multitap is plugged in. With a multitap in the first socket, ports 1 to 6 are on it and the next port is the second socket. 'none' leaves the port empty. It is part of the machine, so a movie needs the same value.",
